WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:04.250
- [Narrator] Education
and food go hand in hand.

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:07.750
And, at one school in a
drought-stricken region of Tanzania,

00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:11.673
one garden program has changed
a generation of school kids.

00:00:12.648 --> 00:00:15.481
(inspiring music)

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:24.532
♪ Tanzania ♪

00:00:24.532 --> 00:00:27.199
(foreign music)

00:00:38.699 --> 00:00:39.937
- One, two three.

00:00:39.937 --> 00:00:41.187
Gardening club.

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:52.230
- [Narrator] The O'Brien
School has around 360 students.

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:54.980
The majority of whom are
from the Maasai tribe.

00:00:54.980 --> 00:00:56.760
An original and nomadic group of people

00:00:56.760 --> 00:00:59.140
whose diets traditionally consist of meat,

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:01.310
milk, blood and fat.

00:01:01.310 --> 00:01:03.610
Farming and eating
vegetables was not a part

00:01:03.610 --> 00:01:06.930
of their lifestyle, but in an
area marked by extreme levels

00:01:06.930 --> 00:01:08.649
of poverty and food scarcity,

00:01:08.649 --> 00:01:12.197
kids were malnourished, and
their education was suffering.

00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:34.890
- [Narrator] So the O'Brien
School did two things:

00:01:34.890 --> 00:01:38.310
they started a garden and
began offering two meals a day

00:01:38.310 --> 00:01:40.877
using the vegetables they grew.

00:02:13.050 --> 00:02:15.320
- [Narrator] The school garden
grows everything from kale

00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:19.243
to cabbage, tomatoes, peppers,
okras, sweet potatoes.

00:02:19.243 --> 00:02:22.436
And each day the students
are responsible for planting,

00:02:22.436 --> 00:02:24.883
tending and harvesting the crops.

00:02:43.538 --> 00:02:45.970
- [Narrator] And these
changes are not confined

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:47.290
to the classroom.

00:02:47.290 --> 00:02:49.350
Students have taken what
they've learned at school

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:50.470
and brought it home.

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:52.310
Planting gardens with their families

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:53.950
and their local villages,

00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:56.623
which is all to say the
the program is working.

00:03:10.637 --> 00:03:13.554
(inspiring music)

